# Code owners: every change requires review from the maintainer.
#
# Maintainer: @fdrissi. The "Protect main" repository ruleset requires review
# from Code Owners, so these reviews are enforced.
#
# Default owner for every path. It must stay first: the last matching pattern
# wins, so the explicit entries below override it.
*                                 @fdrissi

# Sensitive areas (see AGENTS.md and docs/SECURITY_MODEL.md): CI workflows,
# authentication, approvals, publishing/export, budget enforcement (including
# paid provider adapters and workflow budget pre-flight), security helpers,
# release tooling and the secret-scan allowlist, schema migrations, and
# dependency manifests. Keep them listed explicitly so they stay owned by the
# maintainer even if the default owner above changes.

/.github/                         @fdrissi
/.github/workflows/               @fdrissi
/.github/CODEOWNERS               @fdrissi

/src/auth/                        @fdrissi
/src/approvals/                   @fdrissi
/src/budgets/                     @fdrissi
# Paid provider adapters call budgets.reserve / requests.prepare: a change here
# can bypass budget enforcement without touching src/budgets.
/src/integrations/                @fdrissi
# Workflow budget pre-flight and job orchestration (paid runs, approvals).
/src/workflows/                   @fdrissi
/src/jobs/                        @fdrissi
/src/security/                    @fdrissi
/src/config/secrets.ts            @fdrissi
/src/config/env.ts                @fdrissi

# Publishing and export paths (publisher adapters, manual export, mark-implemented)
**/publish*                       @fdrissi
**/publisher*                     @fdrissi
**/export*                        @fdrissi
/src/cli/commands/approvals.ts    @fdrissi

/scripts/                         @fdrissi
/migrations/                      @fdrissi
/prompts/                         @fdrissi

/package.json                     @fdrissi
/package-lock.json                @fdrissi
/Dockerfile                       @fdrissi
/compose.yaml                     @fdrissi
/.dockerignore                    @fdrissi
/.gitignore                       @fdrissi

/SECURITY.md                      @fdrissi
/LICENSE-NOTICE.md                @fdrissi
